WEBVTT

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:05.490
Shugo, shu-

00:00:05.490 --> 00:00:06.760
Shugo, shugo!

00:00:06.760 --> 00:00:08.580
Start it off with a Doki! It's Shugo Chara time!

00:00:08.580 --> 00:00:10.450
No fair! Doing it all by yourself.

00:00:11.420 --> 00:00:15.990
Today, we get called over to Ami-chan's pre-school.

00:00:15.990 --> 00:00:19.600
Something artistic is calling to me!

00:00:19.600 --> 00:00:21.860
So give it lots of energy this time:

00:00:21.860 --> 00:00:22.950
Doki!

00:00:32.760 --> 00:00:34.410
Pyon Pyon

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.570
Fumu Fumu

00:00:35.570 --> 00:00:36.480
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:36.480 --> 00:00:38.080
Howa Howa

00:00:38.080 --> 00:00:39.280
Kira Kira

00:00:39.280 --> 00:00:40.210
Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:40.210 --> 00:00:42.970
What color is your egg?

00:00:42.970 --> 00:00:45.750
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:00:47.730 --> 00:00:50.790
Even if you say mean things,

00:00:51.260 --> 00:00:54.640
I know you really love me.

00:00:55.160 --> 00:00:58.310
Even if we fight a lot,

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.980
it's just 'cause we're always together.

00:01:02.470 --> 00:01:05.040
Because you believe in me,

00:01:06.160 --> 00:01:08.800
I can do anything!

00:01:09.610 --> 00:01:15.100
And that's why I unlock my heart!

00:01:16.970 --> 00:01:20.810
The person you want to be; things you want to say.

00:01:20.810 --> 00:01:24.470
Important things; things that are true.

00:01:24.470 --> 00:01:28.180
Who you are; what you've yet to realize.

00:01:28.180 --> 00:01:31.830
Mysterious things; happy things.

00:01:31.830 --> 00:01:36.740
All of these things are inside your egg!

00:01:39.210 --> 00:01:40.880
Pyon Pyon

00:01:40.880 --> 00:01:42.030
Fumu Fumu

00:01:42.030 --> 00:01:42.970
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:42.970 --> 00:01:44.520
Howa Howa

00:01:44.520 --> 00:01:45.730
Kira Kira

00:01:45.730 --> 00:01:46.680
Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:46.680 --> 00:01:49.420
What color is your egg?

00:01:49.420 --> 00:01:52.230
Yeah! Yeah! Yeah!

00:01:54.890 --> 00:01:56.810
Crap, it's time already?

00:01:56.810 --> 00:01:58.810
Hurry, you'll be late!

00:01:58.810 --> 00:01:59.970
I know, I know!

00:01:59.970 --> 00:02:00.730
Good morning!

00:02:00.730 --> 00:02:02.140
You wied to me!

00:02:02.140 --> 00:02:05.680
You said if I got the gold pwize you'd buy it for me as a reward!

00:02:05.680 --> 00:02:07.480
Wow!

00:02:07.480 --> 00:02:10.460
She won the gold prize in a drawing contest!

00:02:10.460 --> 00:02:12.720
She's not like her sister, I see.

00:02:13.250 --> 00:02:18.220
Now, honey, mommy and daddy searched all around town, but...

00:02:18.220 --> 00:02:19.810
We just couldn't find one.

00:02:20.720 --> 00:02:22.890
I hate Mommy and Daddy!

00:02:24.010 --> 00:02:27.240
Oh no! Say it's just a phase!

00:02:24.790 --> 00:02:27.890
Please calm down. Let's go to your pre-school together, okay?

00:02:27.890 --> 00:02:30.310
I not going with you, Mommy! {intentional}

00:02:30.310 --> 00:02:33.180
Sis is gonna take me today!

00:02:33.180 --> 00:02:34.980
Well, if you insist.

00:02:34.980 --> 00:02:36.140
Please, Amu-chan.

00:02:36.140 --> 00:02:38.680
I have school, too, you know!

00:02:38.680 --> 00:02:41.220
Save us, Amu-chan!

00:02:41.220 --> 00:02:44.220
Okay, wet's all go to pwe-school!

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:49.270
Panic in Plum Class!

00:02:44.220 --> 00:02:49.270
Episode 58

00:02:50.720 --> 00:02:54.430
Let's discuss the ? Egg incidents that have been occurring frequently of late.

00:02:55.270 --> 00:02:59.680
Someone's using children's dreams to search for the Embryo.

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.300
Who the heck would do that?

00:03:02.300 --> 00:03:03.930
Sorry I took so long!

00:03:03.930 --> 00:03:05.960
Amu-chi, you're late!

00:03:05.960 --> 00:03:07.930
That's the third time this month already.

00:03:09.090 --> 00:03:10.600
Amu-chan!

00:03:10.600 --> 00:03:11.510
Yo!

00:03:11.510 --> 00:03:13.600
Il, El, what's up?

00:03:13.600 --> 00:03:16.130
Kiseki called us here.

00:03:16.130 --> 00:03:18.310
What do you have planned for today?

00:03:18.310 --> 00:03:22.890
Today we Guardian Characters will be holding an emergency meeting on the ? Eggs.

00:03:22.890 --> 00:03:26.420
You commoners have no sense of the impending crisis that is upon us!

00:03:26.420 --> 00:03:28.900
Thus, we shall compensate for your lack of-

00:03:28.900 --> 00:03:30.690
You guys!

00:03:30.690 --> 00:03:33.410
Who, exactly, has no sense of crisis?

00:03:33.410 --> 00:03:35.530
Do you even want to do this?

00:03:35.530 --> 00:03:36.850
No.

00:03:36.850 --> 00:03:39.130
I'm too tired-dechu.

00:03:39.130 --> 00:03:41.960
I'm completely stuffed.

00:03:41.960 --> 00:03:44.430
"Still completely unpopular."

00:03:45.890 --> 00:03:49.680
Hey, Amu-chi, where's Ran and the gang?

00:03:49.680 --> 00:03:50.970
Well...

00:03:50.970 --> 00:03:53.580
Farewell!

00:03:54.220 --> 00:03:55.170
Pre-school?

00:03:55.170 --> 00:03:57.350
You let her take the Guardian Characters to pre-school?

00:03:57.350 --> 00:03:59.670
That's just cruel, Amu-chi.

00:03:59.670 --> 00:04:01.430
She's a failure as the Joker, after all.

00:04:01.430 --> 00:04:05.950
But Ami absolutely refused to let go of them!

00:04:05.950 --> 00:04:08.240
Oh? Where did they all go?

00:04:09.100 --> 00:04:12.810
Sheesh, I won't let them get away with skipping such a crucial meeting.

00:04:22.310 --> 00:04:25.520
Looks like something fun is going on-nya!

00:04:32.600 --> 00:04:35.500
Th-They're staring at us.

00:04:35.500 --> 00:04:38.040
Everyone can see us!

00:04:38.040 --> 00:04:39.560
Ta-da!

00:04:39.560 --> 00:04:41.120
I shall intwoduce them to everybody!

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:43.190
These are the Super Characters! {editor: If there was some standard way of translating Ami's mistaken "sugoi chara" instead of this, insert here... maintaining the japanese pun seems impossible}

00:04:43.190 --> 00:04:45.890
Wow, awesome!

00:04:44.200 --> 00:04:45.890
It's Guardian Characters, though.

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:50.330
Is someone actually there?

00:04:51.250 --> 00:04:52.640
I've found you!

00:04:53.530 --> 00:04:55.940
Neat, lots of Super Characters!

00:04:55.940 --> 00:04:56.560
Huh?

00:04:56.560 --> 00:04:59.340
Wow, you guys sure found this place fast.

00:04:59.340 --> 00:05:01.100
We asked Amu-chan.

00:05:01.100 --> 00:05:03.220
What are you lot doing in a place like this?!

00:05:03.220 --> 00:05:05.690
Aren't you forgetting something about today?!

00:05:06.640 --> 00:05:08.590
Like what?

00:05:08.590 --> 00:05:10.440
Today's our Guardian Character meeting!

00:05:10.440 --> 00:05:12.270
Wow!

00:05:17.860 --> 00:05:19.200
Y-You guys.

00:05:19.200 --> 00:05:21.520
What an easy-going bunch. So typical-nya.

00:05:21.520 --> 00:05:23.130
Yoru!

00:05:23.130 --> 00:05:24.020
Yo!

00:05:24.020 --> 00:05:26.290
Why are you here?

00:05:27.270 --> 00:05:31.020
You truly are connected to the ? Egg incidents, aren't you?

00:05:31.020 --> 00:05:33.220
I can't really say-nya.

00:05:33.220 --> 00:05:35.770
Tell us everything you know!

00:05:38.270 --> 00:05:40.770
It's a kitty!

00:05:40.770 --> 00:05:44.980
Kitty, kitty, kitty, kitty!

00:05:42.470 --> 00:05:44.980
Hey, listen to me!

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:48.820
What do you think you're doing?!

00:05:48.820 --> 00:05:50.540
Are you a king?

00:05:50.540 --> 00:05:52.850
Indeed, I am! And just who are<i> you</i>?

00:05:52.850 --> 00:05:56.320
That kid is Ma-kun, the Prince of Clay! {editor, I kind of like "Prince of Putty" for the alliteration, but unfortunately Putty is not really correct... :( }

00:05:56.320 --> 00:05:57.510
Prince?

00:05:57.510 --> 00:05:59.910
You'll model for me.

00:05:59.910 --> 00:06:01.340
Model?

00:06:01.340 --> 00:06:05.800
Sun, sun, Mr. Golden Sun! {To Quark, I know this is probably not actually literal, but I know a real kid's song with those lyrics. I used to be a nanny ^^ But I will change it back if you object :)}

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:10.030
Please shine down on me!

00:06:08.850 --> 00:06:10.720
They're all pretty good, aren't they?

00:06:12.160 --> 00:06:14.100
What is it?

00:06:14.100 --> 00:06:15.640
Kiseki is funny!

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:17.910
Release me this instant!

00:06:17.910 --> 00:06:19.340
Are you listening?

00:06:19.340 --> 00:06:22.460
Don't move. I'm going to sculpt you.

00:06:22.460 --> 00:06:26.960
Stop this at once! I don't know what kind of prince you might be, but I won't allow you to treat the King like this!

00:06:26.960 --> 00:06:29.260
He's really taken a liking to him, I guess.

00:06:29.260 --> 00:06:30.100
Seems like it-dechu.

00:06:31.840 --> 00:06:33.680
Love, love!

00:06:33.680 --> 00:06:37.370
El is an AngELl ! El, El!

00:06:36.840 --> 00:06:38.800
Even though she's Utau's Guardian Character...

00:06:38.800 --> 00:06:39.970
El's singing is...

00:06:39.970 --> 00:06:42.270
Kind of off.

00:06:43.930 --> 00:06:46.520
It's my turn now!

00:06:51.520 --> 00:06:54.140
What's with everyone today?

00:06:54.140 --> 00:06:56.930
Yo, yo, yo!

00:06:56.930 --> 00:06:59.120
My name is Yoru, and that means night! {I sort of shoe-horned the translation note about his name into his rap... It actually helps with the joke of it being a really lame rap...}

00:06:59.120 --> 00:07:01.560
What comes after noon? Yo, yo, yo, Yoru!

00:07:01.560 --> 00:07:03.290
And after night comes...

00:07:02.010 --> 00:07:03.370
Boo! Boo!

00:07:03.290 --> 00:07:04.410
No good?

00:07:04.410 --> 00:07:05.470
Outta my way!

00:07:09.070 --> 00:07:10.630
You fool! Keep your distance!

00:07:10.630 --> 00:07:11.850
It's not like I have a-

00:07:12.920 --> 00:07:14.610
I don't need a cat.

00:07:14.610 --> 00:07:16.620
Thanks for that-nya.

00:07:19.760 --> 00:07:22.300
Hurry up, hurry up!

00:07:28.560 --> 00:07:30.770
Hey, aren't you finished yet?

00:07:30.770 --> 00:07:32.010
Just a little more.

00:07:32.010 --> 00:07:33.600
Don't overdo it.

00:07:33.600 --> 00:07:36.430
I don't have time to loaf about with you.

00:07:36.430 --> 00:07:38.010
I have an important meeting to-

00:07:38.010 --> 00:07:39.220
It's all wrong!

00:07:39.220 --> 00:07:42.350
No, no, no, no!

00:07:42.740 --> 00:07:45.660
I wonder when he'll finish.

00:07:52.440 --> 00:07:54.850
I definitely sensed someone.

00:07:56.140 --> 00:07:57.740
Was it my imagination?

00:07:58.850 --> 00:08:00.850
Plum Class

00:08:06.540 --> 00:08:08.010
What are you doing?!

00:08:10.520 --> 00:08:11.760
Why, you!

00:08:11.760 --> 00:08:13.890
You'll pay for this!

00:08:13.890 --> 00:08:15.890
Utau-chan

00:08:18.200 --> 00:08:19.720
Wait!

00:08:19.720 --> 00:08:20.840
After them!

00:08:20.840 --> 00:08:22.400
Right!

00:08:22.400 --> 00:08:24.310
Hold on, children!

00:08:25.260 --> 00:08:26.560
Oh, I see.

00:08:26.560 --> 00:08:28.400
You want to go outside.

00:08:28.400 --> 00:08:32.150
Not getting enough physical activity is bad for your metabolism.

00:08:32.150 --> 00:08:34.410
In that case, just leave this to El!

00:08:34.410 --> 00:08:38.510
Rabbit-chans: Let's Go Freedom!

00:08:38.510 --> 00:08:41.370
I'll never let you get away with this!

00:08:42.680 --> 00:08:44.350
Wait!

00:08:51.210 --> 00:08:52.600
Wow!

00:08:56.100 --> 00:09:00.470
Kiseki, help us get the rabbits back into their little house!

00:09:00.470 --> 00:09:03.100
Lend me a hand, you guys!

00:09:04.470 --> 00:09:06.450
Yay!

00:09:08.290 --> 00:09:09.630
That rocked-nya.

00:09:09.630 --> 00:09:11.390
You're getting soft, Yoru!

00:09:11.390 --> 00:09:14.870
The rabbits are now my servants! Prepare yourself!

00:09:14.870 --> 00:09:16.010
What-nya?

00:09:17.640 --> 00:09:21.310
I'll remember this!

00:09:23.460 --> 00:09:24.760
What a fool.

00:09:26.330 --> 00:09:29.070
We got a lot of exercise.

00:09:29.070 --> 00:09:30.720
I'm sorry.

00:09:30.720 --> 00:09:32.850
What did you do?

00:09:33.560 --> 00:09:35.970
Commence firing!

00:09:35.970 --> 00:09:38.120
Do not be defeated, my loyal subjects!

00:09:48.260 --> 00:09:51.680
They are so feminine and shiny!

00:09:51.680 --> 00:09:53.140
Ready, set...

00:10:04.460 --> 00:10:07.370
The city looks like it's rainbow-colored.

00:10:07.370 --> 00:10:10.120
We're the winners!

00:10:19.250 --> 00:10:22.310
It's just so darn pretty.

00:10:22.310 --> 00:10:24.430
It's wrong!

00:10:24.430 --> 00:10:32.140
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:10:44.130 --> 00:10:47.710
You sure you don't mind coming with me to pick Ami up?

00:10:47.710 --> 00:10:51.950
It's no problem at all. I'm worried about Kiseki as well.

00:10:51.950 --> 00:10:55.260
I'm all alone with Tadase-kun right now!

00:10:55.500 --> 00:10:59.190
Ah, what'll I do? I'm suddenly nervous.

00:10:59.190 --> 00:11:01.420
Hinamori-san, is something wrong?

00:11:01.420 --> 00:11:03.190
No, I'm fine.

00:11:03.190 --> 00:11:05.360
Christmas is still too far away.

00:11:05.360 --> 00:11:08.040
The thing to talk about during this season is...

00:11:08.570 --> 00:11:11.220
Grapes sure are delicious this time of year, don't you think?

00:11:12.970 --> 00:11:15.240
Oh, are you hungry, Hinamori-san?

00:11:15.240 --> 00:11:18.330
No, that's not what I meant!

00:11:18.330 --> 00:11:20.910
Sis!

00:11:20.910 --> 00:11:23.220
Ami, were you a good girl today?

00:11:23.220 --> 00:11:27.890
Yesh! Since da Super Characters were all here, we had wots of fun today!

00:11:27.890 --> 00:11:29.490
See ya later, Ami!

00:11:29.490 --> 00:11:30.630
I had a blast!

00:11:30.630 --> 00:11:32.150
Until next time!

00:11:32.150 --> 00:11:34.560
Play with us again sometime-dechu.

00:11:34.560 --> 00:11:36.390
Sure, bye-bye!

00:11:37.860 --> 00:11:39.620
You guys.

00:11:39.620 --> 00:11:40.840
We didn't do anything!

00:11:40.840 --> 00:11:41.810
For real!

00:11:42.400 --> 00:11:44.320
The rabbits smell.

00:11:44.320 --> 00:11:46.590
Kiseki, how did the meeting go?

00:11:46.590 --> 00:11:49.360
Tadase, do not underestimate those children.

00:11:49.360 --> 00:11:54.190
One day, they may become a hindrance to our plans for world domination.

00:11:54.820 --> 00:11:57.080
Hey, Kiseki, it's finished.

00:11:58.780 --> 00:12:01.380
What?! This is me?

00:12:01.380 --> 00:12:02.140
I-It's the spitting image!

00:12:02.140 --> 00:12:02.900
What?!

00:12:03.680 --> 00:12:05.790
Did you make these?

00:12:05.790 --> 00:12:09.030
That's right. I made all these on display here.

00:12:09.840 --> 00:12:11.100
That's impressive.

00:12:11.100 --> 00:12:14.330
Ma-kun is very good with clay! He's the Prin-

00:12:16.510 --> 00:12:17.880
It's a good color, don't you think?

00:12:17.880 --> 00:12:21.550
I worked on this clay dragon for half a year.

00:12:21.550 --> 00:12:23.570
Quite an individual, I see.

00:12:23.570 --> 00:12:27.450
Yeah. He really has the sensibilities of an artist.

00:12:27.450 --> 00:12:30.190
Ma-kun's daddy is a sculptor!

00:12:30.190 --> 00:12:32.580
Ah, it all makes sense!

00:12:43.220 --> 00:12:44.610
This is not who I am!

00:12:46.440 --> 00:12:49.180
Yeah? I think it looks just like you.

00:12:49.180 --> 00:12:52.350
Especially the way your mouth looks when you're angry.

00:12:52.350 --> 00:12:54.260
He really captured your features.

00:12:54.260 --> 00:12:56.650
Ma-kun is a genius!

00:12:56.650 --> 00:12:59.430
Silence! What part of <i>that</i> looks like me?

00:12:59.430 --> 00:13:01.700
It doesn't show any of my Kingly dignity!

00:13:01.700 --> 00:13:03.310
Dignity?

00:13:03.530 --> 00:13:09.850
It has none of the dignity of a King; the willpower and strength combined with the adoration of his subjects!

00:13:10.690 --> 00:13:11.470
Eureka!

00:13:14.750 --> 00:13:22.640
No, no, no.

00:13:18.450 --> 00:13:20.730
He has incredible concentration.

00:13:20.730 --> 00:13:22.640
I think it's about time we went home.

00:13:24.210 --> 00:13:28.680
Ma-kun, your mother is running late at work,

00:13:28.680 --> 00:13:30.330
so why don't we read a picture book together?

00:13:32.220 --> 00:13:34.950
Everyone is acting strangely today for some reason.

00:13:37.560 --> 00:13:39.960
So that's the kid you found, Nana?

00:13:39.960 --> 00:13:42.570
He keeps sayin' "no, no." He's totally lost!

00:13:42.570 --> 00:13:45.220
I can definitely feel the power.

00:13:45.550 --> 00:13:49.410
No, no, no, no!

00:13:47.520 --> 00:13:49.410
You're lost, aren't you?

00:13:50.330 --> 00:13:52.640
You can't create what you want to make.

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:58.920
This is magic jewelry.

00:13:58.920 --> 00:14:02.600
If you put this on, your dreams will come true.

00:14:02.600 --> 00:14:05.660
You will be able to create everything you want to create.

00:14:14.510 --> 00:14:19.140
Just do what y'all wanna to do!

00:14:19.140 --> 00:14:21.900
? Character Change.

00:14:23.330 --> 00:14:25.540
I'm sorry, Tadase-kun.

00:14:25.540 --> 00:14:29.130
Oh, I'm fine. She's really tuckered out.

00:14:32.730 --> 00:14:35.570
It's like we're a family. This is kind of nice.

00:14:37.620 --> 00:14:38.770
It's from Yaya.

00:14:38.770 --> 00:14:41.810
Amu-chi, we've got trouble! There's an emergency!

00:14:42.050 --> 00:14:43.720
An emergency?

00:14:48.040 --> 00:14:49.060
Look at that!

00:14:50.790 --> 00:14:51.800
That's...

00:14:51.800 --> 00:14:53.640
There's so much clay!

00:14:55.290 --> 00:14:57.800
Wowy, wowy!

00:14:57.800 --> 00:14:59.430
If you look carefully...

00:15:03.120 --> 00:15:04.100
Could it be...

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:08.420
No, no, no.

00:15:08.420 --> 00:15:09.430
Ma-kun!

00:15:09.430 --> 00:15:13.100
No, no, no.

00:15:13.100 --> 00:15:14.490
It's a ? Egg!

00:15:14.490 --> 00:15:15.480
Amu-chan!

00:15:15.480 --> 00:15:16.410
Right!

00:15:19.300 --> 00:15:20.420
My heart:

00:15:20.420 --> 00:15:21.850
My heart:

00:15:21.850 --> 00:15:23.190
My heart:

00:15:23.190 --> 00:15:24.890
My heart:

00:15:24.890 --> 00:15:26.100
Unlock!

00:15:52.040 --> 00:15:54.810
Character Transformation: Platinum Royal!

00:15:56.180 --> 00:15:58.240
Character Transformation: Clown Drop!

00:15:59.370 --> 00:16:01.790
Character Transformation: Dear Baby!

00:16:03.840 --> 00:16:06.460
Character Transformation: Amulet Heart!

00:16:09.680 --> 00:16:11.510
Ma-kun, stop this already!

00:16:11.720 --> 00:16:14.910
Don't get in my way!

00:16:14.910 --> 00:16:16.150
Heart Rod!

00:16:18.380 --> 00:16:22.470
Spiral Heart Special!

00:16:26.660 --> 00:16:27.430
No way!

00:16:27.430 --> 00:16:29.720
In times like this, just leave things to me!

00:16:30.550 --> 00:16:33.070
Go Go Little Duckies!

00:16:42.800 --> 00:16:44.060
Don't let your guard down.

00:16:44.060 --> 00:16:45.290
I'm sorry.

00:16:46.390 --> 00:16:48.380
There's lots of clay!

00:16:48.380 --> 00:16:52.220
What should we do? The more we attack, the more clay there is.

00:16:53.310 --> 00:16:54.840
Well now, whatever shall you do?

00:16:54.840 --> 00:16:56.470
This here's gonna be fun!

00:16:56.700 --> 00:16:58.410
Look, Amu-chan!

00:16:58.410 --> 00:17:00.850
All the clay is joining together!

00:17:09.850 --> 00:17:11.430
K-Kiseki?

00:17:11.430 --> 00:17:12.950
It's magnificent!

00:17:12.950 --> 00:17:14.100
Wowy!

00:17:14.410 --> 00:17:16.950
Juggling Party!

00:17:18.850 --> 00:17:20.010
Holy Crown!

00:17:23.220 --> 00:17:24.450
What are you doing?

00:17:24.450 --> 00:17:25.850
Don't interfere!

00:17:25.850 --> 00:17:26.970
Well, I'm...

00:17:32.390 --> 00:17:34.160
Hey, Tadase!

00:17:34.160 --> 00:17:35.370
That was so cruel.

00:17:35.370 --> 00:17:37.060
But I...

00:17:38.250 --> 00:17:38.740
Kiseki?

00:17:39.350 --> 00:17:43.720
You are merely commoners, I will not allow you to strike back at your King!

00:17:43.720 --> 00:17:46.940
It's powerful and excitin', y'all!

00:17:46.940 --> 00:17:49.260
Get a move on! Get to it! All righty!

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:56.100
No, no, no, no, no, no, no.

00:17:56.370 --> 00:17:58.620
Unless we stop Ma-kun from using the clay...

00:17:58.620 --> 00:18:00.280
Ran, switch with me!

00:18:00.280 --> 00:18:01.140
Okay!

00:18:05.310 --> 00:18:07.820
Character Transformation: Amulet Spade!

00:18:09.630 --> 00:18:11.280
Ma-kun, that's enough already.

00:18:12.050 --> 00:18:14.430
Is that really what you wanted to make with the clay?

00:18:15.640 --> 00:18:16.780
Yes.

00:18:17.720 --> 00:18:19.640
Amu-chan, don't give up!

00:18:20.290 --> 00:18:24.300
No! This isn't what you wanted to create!

00:18:24.300 --> 00:18:26.180
Yes, it is!

00:18:28.440 --> 00:18:30.810
Colorful Canvas!

00:18:35.160 --> 00:18:37.050
Why, y-

00:18:37.050 --> 00:18:39.450
Hinamori-san, you can do it!

00:18:39.450 --> 00:18:41.470
Ma-kun, listen to what I'm telling you!

00:18:41.740 --> 00:18:44.300
No, no, no.

00:18:44.300 --> 00:18:45.740
If you don't listen to me,

00:18:45.740 --> 00:18:47.760
I'm going to get angry!

00:18:49.660 --> 00:18:52.590
Your words finally reached him!

00:18:52.590 --> 00:18:55.060
Amu-chan, use Open Heart!

00:18:56.640 --> 00:18:58.330
Negative Heart:

00:18:58.330 --> 00:18:59.600
Lock On!

00:19:01.290 --> 00:19:04.140
He doesn't actually have a negative heart.

00:19:04.140 --> 00:19:05.430
Oh, right.

00:19:05.430 --> 00:19:07.300
Then, Lost Heart!

00:19:07.300 --> 00:19:09.100
But is he really lost?

00:19:09.310 --> 00:19:13.470
No, no, no, no, no, no.

00:19:13.470 --> 00:19:15.740
He actually looks like he's enjoying himself.

00:19:15.740 --> 00:19:16.880
He does!

00:19:16.880 --> 00:19:20.380
When it comes to art, finding your way is the fun part.

00:19:21.350 --> 00:19:22.560
It's coming!

00:19:22.560 --> 00:19:23.810
Amu-chan, hurry!

00:19:23.810 --> 00:19:24.970
Fine, I got it!

00:19:24.970 --> 00:19:26.220
Broken Heart!

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:26.700
That's wrong, too.

00:19:26.700 --> 00:19:27.760
Jagged Heart!

00:19:27.760 --> 00:19:28.250
Nope.

00:19:28.250 --> 00:19:30.750
What should I do?!

00:19:31.540 --> 00:19:32.560
It's finished!

00:19:44.140 --> 00:19:45.880
What's that?

00:19:45.880 --> 00:19:47.280
Could it be...

00:19:47.280 --> 00:19:48.930
Exactly, it is me!

00:19:49.160 --> 00:19:53.380
That is the true form of a dignified King!

00:19:53.380 --> 00:19:57.730
You have done well!

00:20:01.120 --> 00:20:02.970
My...

00:20:03.550 --> 00:20:05.470
What is this supposed to mean?

00:20:05.470 --> 00:20:08.820
What's goin' on?! Go rampagin' some more!

00:20:08.820 --> 00:20:10.490
Get a move on! Get to it!

00:20:15.960 --> 00:20:17.030
I'm bored with this.

00:20:34.080 --> 00:20:36.390
Ma-kun!

00:20:36.390 --> 00:20:37.530
Mommy!

00:20:39.430 --> 00:20:41.670
Ma-kun, where did you go?

00:20:41.670 --> 00:20:43.180
I was worried about you.

00:20:43.390 --> 00:20:45.680
Hey, Mommy, buy me some origami!

00:20:45.680 --> 00:20:47.040
Origami?

00:20:47.040 --> 00:20:48.620
Not clay?

00:20:48.620 --> 00:20:51.680
I'm bored with clay. I want to play with origami now.

00:20:51.680 --> 00:20:52.840
Origami!

00:20:52.840 --> 00:20:54.590
That's too sudden a shift.

00:20:54.590 --> 00:20:56.680
Little kids are scary.

00:20:58.200 --> 00:20:59.880
Nana.

00:20:59.880 --> 00:21:02.130
What's with that? It was totally worthless!

00:21:02.130 --> 00:21:04.560
Maybe if you had some power, this wouldn't a happened! {"a happened" is intentional, but I think it was like that to begin with.}

00:21:04.560 --> 00:21:06.720
Are you implying this was my fault?

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.720
Take that back, this instant! {this and the next line overlap and are my best guess as they are Ad libbed and hard to hear}

00:21:06.720 --> 00:21:08.720
No, <i>you</i> take it back, Lulu!

00:21:08.720 --> 00:21:12.260
Ami-chan, we finally found one!

00:21:14.720 --> 00:21:17.080
I wuv you, Mommy and Daddy!

00:21:17.080 --> 00:21:19.430
Thank goodness, thank goodness!

00:21:19.690 --> 00:21:21.600
Ta-da!

00:21:21.600 --> 00:21:25.010
So this is the present you wanted, Ami?

00:21:25.010 --> 00:21:25.700
Yesh!

00:21:25.700 --> 00:21:27.200
It's a dollhouse.

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:28.570
A dollhouse?

00:21:28.570 --> 00:21:31.240
A house for dolls. {wow, this sounds so totally dumb in translation :) }

00:21:31.240 --> 00:21:32.700
Incorrect!

00:21:33.350 --> 00:21:37.120
Dis is a house for Super Characters!

00:21:39.070 --> 00:21:41.330
It's sad to wive in an egg, right?

00:21:41.330 --> 00:21:45.810
So dat's why I asked Mommy and Daddy to buy it for you.

00:21:45.810 --> 00:21:47.230
Ami-chan.

00:21:47.230 --> 00:21:49.740
You did all this just for us?

00:21:49.740 --> 00:21:51.300
We are so thankful!

00:21:54.060 --> 00:21:59.440
We're tired from playing so much today, so let's go ahead and move in.

00:21:59.440 --> 00:22:01.810
All right. But we need to decide on who gets what room, right?

00:22:01.810 --> 00:22:03.350
Huh? Where's Ran?

00:22:03.350 --> 00:22:05.350
This is my room!

00:22:05.350 --> 00:22:06.690
No fair, Ran!

00:22:06.690 --> 00:22:10.670
That is the room I was considering!

00:22:16.180 --> 00:22:18.010
Is anybody...

00:22:22.950 --> 00:22:23.450
(For real?)

00:22:25.680 --> 00:22:26.190
(Eh?)

00:22:26.190 --> 00:22:28.400
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:28.880 --> 00:22:31.120
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:31.660 --> 00:22:36.600
If we ended up becoming adults today, {kyou mo}

00:22:36.600 --> 00:22:41.230
I bet we'd lose sight of everything except what's in front of us. {kitto}

00:22:41.230 --> 00:22:42.570
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:42.570 --> 00:22:47.500
So I wonder what we've been {kyoumade}

00:22:47.500 --> 00:22:52.140
so engrossed with finding all this time. {honto}

00:22:52.140 --> 00:22:53.400
Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:22:53.400 --> 00:22:55.130
Someone once said: {dare ga}

00:22:55.130 --> 00:22:58.040
"We were born to be happy, {shiawase}

00:22:58.040 --> 00:23:04.000
so let's live to make others happy!" {soshite}

00:23:05.630 --> 00:23:06.780
How long will I have to  {dore kurai}

00:23:06.780 --> 00:23:08.480
carry all this love in my heart?  {mune ippai}

00:23:08.480 --> 00:23:09.530
How long will I have to {dore kurai}

00:23:09.530 --> 00:23:11.150
carry all this love in my heart?  {mune ippai}

00:23:11.150 --> 00:23:16.660
I wonder when I'll be able to let it all out. {kakaetara}

00:23:16.660 --> 00:23:17.660
How many of {dore kurai}

00:23:17.660 --> 00:23:19.310
all those days in my heart...  {mune ippai}

00:23:19.310 --> 00:23:20.370
How many of{dore kurai}

00:23:20.370 --> 00:23:22.130
all those days in my heart...  {mune ippai}

00:23:22.130 --> 00:23:27.540
How many of them have we run through? {ano hi}

00:23:27.540 --> 00:23:28.590
With this much love {kore kurai}

00:23:28.590 --> 00:23:30.280
filling my heart...  {mune ippai}

00:23:30.280 --> 00:23:31.370
With this much love{kore kurai}

00:23:31.370 --> 00:23:32.950
filling my heart... {mune ippai}

00:23:32.950 --> 00:23:35.670
I hugged you tightly, {kimi wo}

00:23:35.670 --> 00:23:41.210
and during that time, we both felt so much happiness. {futari}

00:23:41.210 --> 00:23:43.390
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:43.390 --> 00:23:43.890
(Why?)

00:23:43.890 --> 00:23:46.080
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:46.610 --> 00:23:48.880
Lotta love! Lotta love! Lotta love!

00:23:49.160 --> 00:23:50.190
(Phew...)

00:23:50.890 --> 00:23:53.420
It must be tough to be small.

00:23:53.420 --> 00:23:55.910
No kidding, I'm totally beat.

00:23:55.910 --> 00:23:59.170
It looks like it'll be rough going next time, too.

00:23:59.170 --> 00:24:02.740
El was making a big fuss about helping out at Utau's concert.

00:24:02.740 --> 00:24:05.400
But I guess we should work hard, too.

00:24:05.400 --> 00:24:07.770
La-la-la!

00:24:07.770 --> 00:24:10.130
It's not <i>your</i> concert!

00:24:10.130 --> 00:24:12.200
Next time on Shugo Chara!! Doki:

00:24:12.200 --> 00:24:14.490
Hoshina Utau! A Fresh Start!

00:24:14.490 --> 00:24:16.420
Let's get everyone excited!

00:24:16.420 --> 00:24:17.410
Yeah!

00:24:17.410 --> 00:24:19.250
You think Ikuto will come?
